        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A strongyloidiasis that involves infection of intestine with Strongyloides stercoralis, which results in abdominal pain, diarrhea, ileus, massive gastrointestinal bleeding, severe malabsorption, and peritonitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
