        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A mansonelliasis that involves parasitic infection by the nematode Mansonella streptocerca, which resides in the dermis and subcutaneous tissue causing pruritus, papular eruptions and pigmentation changes. Midges transmit the disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
