        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A dengue disease that results_in infection, has_material_basis_in Dengue virus (Orthoflavivirus denguei), which are transmitted_by Aedes mosquito bite. The infection has no manifestations of symptoms.</obo:IAO_0000115>
