        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A Simplexvirus infectious disease that results_in inflammation located_in liver, has-agent Human herpesvirus 1 or has_material_basis_in Human herpesvirus 2, and has_symptom fever, has_symptom nausea, has_symptom vomiting, has_symptom abdominal pain, and has_symptom herpetic lesions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
