        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A parasitic infectious disease that involves infection caused by parasitic members of the taxon stramenopiles, in which the flagellate cells possess two different shaped flagella. This taxon contains both unicellular and multicellular organisms.</owl:annotatedTarget>
