        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An adrenal gland disease that is characterized by cortisol deficiency, hypoaldosteronism and excessive or insufficient sex hormones, has_material_basis_in the mutation in the gene for 21-hydroxylase, 11beta-hydroxylase, 3beta-hydroxysteroid, 17alpha-hydroxylase or 20,22-desmolase.</obo:IAO_0000115>
