        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">An osteochondrodysplasia characterized by postnatal-onset disproportionate short stature, relatively large head, narrow thorax, lumbar lordosis, short limbs, and brachydactyly with small broad nails and that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the Indian hedgehog homolog (IHH) gene on chromosome 2q35.</owl:annotatedTarget>
