        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A syndromic X-linked intellectual disability characterized by severe intellectual deficit, epilepsy, microcephaly, hypogenitalism and obesity with variable occurrence of growth delay and diabetes that has_material_basis_in hemizygous mutation in the EIF2S3 gene on chromosome Xp22.</obo:IAO_0000115>
