        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A macular degeneration characterized by abnormal accumulation of lipofuscin in the retinal pigment epithelium in a distinct pattern, patterns include; reticular (&apos;fishnet-like&apos;), macroreticular (&apos;spider-shaped&apos;), and butterfly-shaped.</obo:IAO_0000115>
