        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A vitamin metabolic disorder characterized by recurrent infections, hepatosplenomegaly, anemia (unresponsive to iron supplementation) and chronic systemic inflammation in the presence of high plasma concentrations of zinc and calprotectin that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the PSTPIP1 gene on chromosome 15q24.</owl:annotatedTarget>
