        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A Joubert syndrome that is characterized by a distinctive hindbrain malformation affecting the midbrain and cerebellum, recognizable as the &apos;molar tooth sign&apos; on brain imaging and that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the TOGARAM1 gene on chromosome 14q21.2.</owl:annotatedTarget>
