        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">An autosomal recessive intellectual developmental disorder characterized by delayed psychomotor development, intellectual disability, and abnormal motor function, including hypotonia, dystonia, ataxia, and spasticity that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the WARS2 gene on chromosome 1p12.</owl:annotatedTarget>
