        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An autosomal dominant intellectual developmental disorder characterized by severely delayed psychomotor development apparent from infancy including delayed and difficulty walking, intellectual disability, and absent speech; decreased cortical white matter often with other brain anomalies; and variable additional features including hip dysplasia, tapering fingers, and seizures that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the RAB11B gene on chromosome 19p13.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MIM:617807</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
