        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">An autosomal recessive intellectual developmental disorder characterized by developmental delay, microcephaly, impaired speech and ambulation, epilepsy, and cortical malformations, with a relatively wide spectrum of severity ranging from early death to intellectual disability with mild motor impairment, that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the TMX2 gene on chromosome 11q12.</owl:annotatedTarget>
