            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 1 characterized by foot deformities, upper or lower limb sensory disturbances, and motor deficits (mainly impaired gait) that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the FBLN5 gene, encoding fibulin-5, on chromosome 14q32. The disorder is slowly progressive and becomes more apparent with age.</obo:IAO_0000115>
