        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A megalencephalic leukoencephalopathy with subcortical cysts characterized by infantile-onset macrocephaly and mildly delayed motor development associated with white matter abnormalities that improve with age, and sometimes mental retardation that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the HEPACAM gene on chromosome 11q24.</obo:IAO_0000115>
