        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A benign familial infantile epilepsy that is characterized by afebrile partial complex or generalized tonic-clonic seizures occurring between 3 and 12 months of age with a good response to medication and no neurologic sequelae and that has_material_basis_in mutation in the CHRNA2 gene on chromosome 8p21.</obo:IAO_0000115>
