        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An anaplastic astrocytoma that is characterized by high-grade piloid and/or glioblastoma-like histological features. It may occur anywhere in the central nervous system but most often arises in the posterior fossa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
