            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A hereditary retinal dystrophy that is characterized by loss of central vision as a result of macular disease by the fourth to fifth decade and peripheral visual loss in late life, and that has_material_basis_in autosomal dominant inheritance of heterozygous mutation in the TIMP metallopeptidase inhibitor 3 (TIMP3) gene on chromosome 22q12.</obo:IAO_0000115>
