        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A nervous system disease characterized by autosomal recessive inheritance of spinocerebellar ataxia and peripheral neuropathy that has_material_basis_in homozygosity for a mutation in the TDP1 gene on chromosome 14q32.11.</obo:IAO_0000115>
