        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A Warburg micro syndrome characterized by microcephaly, microphthalmia, microcornea, congenital cataracts, optic atrophy, cortical dysplasia, in particular corpus callosum hypoplasia, severely impaired intellectual development, spastic diplegia, and hypogonadism that has_material_basis_in autosomal recessive inheritance of homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the RAB3GAP1 gene on chromosome 2q21.</owl:annotatedTarget>
