        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A vitamin metabolic disorder characterized by vitamin B6 deficienc resulting in neonatal-onset of severe seizures that can be controlled with pyridoxal 5&apos;-phosphate treatment that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in PNPO on 17q21.32.</owl:annotatedTarget>
