        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A syndromic intellectual disability characterized by developmental delay, growth retardation with a small head circumference, facial dysmorphisms, and low cholesterol levels that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the UBE3B gene on chromosome 12q24.11.</obo:IAO_0000115>
