        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A heart disease characterized by a broad spectrum of cardiac arrhythmias including; bradycardia, sinus arrhythmia, delayed conduction/conduction block, idiopathic ventricular fibrillation, and catecholaminergic polymorphic ventricular tachycardia that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the ANK2 gene on chromosome 4q25-q26.</obo:IAO_0000115>
