            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A primary immunodeficiency disease characterized by recurrent infections starting in the first year of life, lymphopenia, altered production of various cytokines, inflammatory polyarthritis, and chronic active inflammation of the digestive tract that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the RIPK1 gene on chromosome 6p25.2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
