            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A combined T cell and B cells immunodeficiency characterized by marked atopy and autoimmunity caused by increased T(H)2 and T(H)17 cytokine production by CD4(+) T cells, T-cell lymphopenia, reduced memory B-cell numbers, recurrent respiratory and skin infections beginning in early childhood, increased serum IgE, and variable developmental delay or intellectual impairment that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the PGM3 gene on chromosome 6q14.1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GARD:4331</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MIM:615816</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
