        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A syndrome characterized by short stature, microcephaly, syndactyly, intellectual disability, pre- and postnatal growth failure, and facial dysmorphism that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the CKAP2L gene on chromosome 2q14.1.</owl:annotatedTarget>
