    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_10305">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A Mumps virus infectious disease that results_in inflammation located_in testis, has_material_basis_in Mumps virus, which is transmitted_by droplet spread of saliva or mucus from the mouth, nose, or throat of an infected person, or transmitted_by contaminated fomites. The infection has_symptom groin pain, has_symptom discharge from penis, has_symptom scrotal swelling, and has_symptom blood in the semen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
