        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral infectious disease that results_in infection located_in brain, has_material_basis_in Japanese encephalitis virus (Orthoflavivirus japonicum), which is transmitted_by Culex tritaeniorhynchus mosquito bite. The infection has_symptom headache, has_symptom high fever, has_symptom neck stiffness, has_symptom stupor, has_symptom disorientation, has_symptom coma, has_symptom tremors, has_symptom convulsions, and has_symptom spastic paralysis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
