        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral infectious disease that results in necrosis located in intercostal muscle and has_material_basis_in Human enterovirus B (Enterovirus betacoxsackie). The infection has symptom severe chest pain, has symptom fever, has symptom malaise, has symptom pleuritis, and has symptom headache.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD10CM:B33.0</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
