        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A brucellosis that involves an infection caused by Brucella suis in swine and humans. The disease has_symptom fever, has_symptom chills, has_symptom malaise, has_symptom diaphoresis, has_symptom arthralgia, has_symptom myalgia, has_symptom headache, has_symptom anorexia, and has_symptom fatigue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
