        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A dermatophytosis that results_in fungal infection located_in skin of foot, especially between the toes, has_material_basis_in Trichophyton or has_material_basis_in Epidermophyton and has_symptom fissures, has_symptom scaling, has_symptom maceration, and eroded areas between the toes and on the plantar surface of the foot.</obo:IAO_0000115>
