        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A sarcoidosis that is characterized by involvement of the nervous symptom with cranial nerve palsy, diffuse meningeal disease, acute polyneuropathy, myelitis, or hypothalamic pituitary axis malformation, develops_from a type IV hypersensitivity reaction with noncaseating granulomas involving the nervous system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
