        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral hepatitis that results_in inflammation located_in liver, has_material_basis_in Hepatitis B virus (Orthohepadnavirus hominoidei), which is transmitted_by sexual contact, blood transfusions, or fomites like needles or syringes. The infection has_symptom fever, fatigue, loss of appetite, nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain, clay-colored bowel movements, joint pain, and jaundice.</obo:IAO_0000115>
