        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral infectious disease that results_in infection, has_material_basis_in West Nile virus (Orthoflavivirus nilense), which is transmitted_by Culex and transmitted_by Aedes mosquitoes. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom sore throat, has_symptom headache, has_symptom body ache, has_symptom nausea, has_symptom maculopapular rash and has_symptom vomiting.</obo:IAO_0000115>
