        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A Coronavirus infectious disease that results_in infection located_in respiratory tract, has_material_basis_in Severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus (SARS-CoV or SARS-CoV-1), a subtype of Betacoronavirus pandemicum, which is transmitted_by droplet spread of respiratory secretions, transmitted_by ingestion of contaminated food, or transmitted_by fomites. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom headache, has_symptom body aches, has_symptom dry cough, and has_symptom hypoxia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
