    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_3297">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral infectious disease that results_in infection located_in eyes or located_in upper respiratory tract of domestic rabbits, has_material_basis_in Myxoma virus, which is transmitted_by mosquitos, transmitted_by biting flies or transmitted_by direct contact. The infection has_symptom conjunctivitis with a milky discharge from the inflamed eye and has_symptom breathing difficulties.</obo:IAO_0000115>
