        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral infectious disease that results_in infection in cattle, has_material_basis_in Rinderpest virus, which is transmitted_by direct contact with an infected animal, or transmitted_by ingestion of contaminated water. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom nasal and eye discharge, and results_in_formation_of erosions in the mouth, the lining of the nose and the genital tract.</obo:IAO_0000115>
