        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral hepatitis that results_in inflammation located_in liver, has_material_basis_in Hepatitis E virus (Paslahepevirus balayani), which is transmitted_by ingestion of contaminated food. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom fatigue, has_symptom loss of appetite, has_symptom nausea, has_symptom vomiting, has_symptom abdominal pain, has_symptom clay-colored bowel movements, has_symptom dark urine, has_symptom joint pain, and has_symptom jaundice.</obo:IAO_0000115>
