        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral infectious disease that results_in infection of cattle and humans, located_in skin, has_material_basis_in Pseudocowpox virus (Parapoxvirus pseudocowpox), which is transmitted_by contact with the infected cow teats, or transmitted_by fomites. The infection results_in_formation_of lesions on the fingers, hands, and forearms and has_symptom fever, has_symptom lymphangitis, and has_symptom lymphadenopathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD10CM:B08.04</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
