        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A Varicellovirus infectious disease that results_in inflammation located_in meninges, has_material_basis_in Human herpesvirus 3, which reactivates after the primary infection. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom headache, has_symptom cervical rigidity, has_symptom seizure, has_symptom ataxia, and has_symptom skin lesions.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>url:http://synapse.koreamed.org/Synapse/Data/PDFData/0052KJP/kjp-52-705.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
