        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000576"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A chest pain that is characterized by an inflammation of the pleural cavity with a sharp pain resulting from the exansion of the lungs as the inflammed pleural layers rub against each other.</obo:IAO_0000115>
