        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000464"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A lack of expected normal physiological development in childhood that is characterized by a decelerated or arrested physical growth (height and weight measurements fall below the third or fifth percentile, or a downward change in growth across two major growth percentiles) and is associated with abnormal growth and development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
