        <owl:annotatedTarget>A urinary stream symptom that is characterized by a slow or weak stream of urine.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>url:https://www.besturologistnyc.com/what-is-slow-urine-flow</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
