        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000482"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An alteration of consciousness that is characterized by a loss of consciousness resulting from insufficient blood flow to the brain and limb weakness progressing to collapse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
