        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000099"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pain that is characterized by a pain in, or about, a testis (testicle) or testes. Testicular pain can be caused by nerve damage, sexually transmitted infections, gangrene, swelling, hernia, kidney stones, inflammation, enlarged veins, fluid in the testicle, or a severe condition known as testicular torsion.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>symptoms</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>SYMP:0000768</oboInOwl:id>
