        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000387"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Hyperemia of the face is a head symptom consisting of an excess of blood in the tissues of the face as from an increased flow of blood due to vasodilation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
