        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000030"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A paralysis that is characterized by a tonic spasm of the affected muscles and with increased tendon reflexes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
