        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000299"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Congested sclera is a hyperemia characterized as the congestion of the vessels of the outer layer of the eye containing collagen and elastic fibers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
