        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SYMP_0000858"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Freezing hypokinesia is a hypkinesia where a person can not move their muscles how they want them to.</obo:IAO_0000115>
